# Allowlist: only what the image build reads is sent to the builder.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!src/
!deploy/docker/wheelhouse/

# Never send these, even below an allowed path: VCS data, environments, build
# output, caches, runtime state, local configuration and secrets.
**/.git
**/.omc
**/.venv
**/venv
**/build
**/dist
**/*.egg-info
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.coverage*
**/htmlcov
**/var
**/workspace
**/config.toml
**/*.env
**/.env*
**/secrets
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
